    "lab08-02": {
      "narration": "With the starting conditions prepared, let us follow the recorded run. L-417 must start on in daylight with a manual override. Read the main application Walkthrough and choose Restore L-417 to scheduled mode, agent. Wait until Operator input required actually appears. The agent has selected restore scheduled mode; the remote tool is waiting for input. Deny first. A refusal is a successful exercise of control, not a broken demo. We are looking for a cancellation answer and an unchanged Hub command receipt, not simply a button that disappears."
    }
